        "description": "Every craigslist area site: id, hostname, link, name, short name, abbreviation, country, region, latitude, longitude, time zone and its sub-areas (code and name). Filter by country, region or words.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/craigslist-sites",
